<form name="XGettingStarted" startPoint="false" themePath="lime" process="Post-GettingStarted" blockBackButton="false">
<items>
<skipInstructions>
<skip to="__EndOfForm__"/>
</skipInstructions>
<text label="T1" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Delete above item when done showing site.</font></paragraph></text>
<heading label="H1" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Getting Started</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T2" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="AdminDash" project=""><displayText><string value="Return to Dashboard"/>
</displayText></invitation></u></font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q1" onlyone="true" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Please choose:</font></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Building the Constituent Database - a Step-by-Step Guide</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="b"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Building the Supporter Databse - a Step-by-Step Guide</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<skipInstructions>
</skipInstructions>
<heading label="H2" type="Sub"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Getting Started - Step One</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T3" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="XGettingStarted" project=""><displayText><string value="cancel"/>
</displayText></invitation></u></font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T4" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>The following steps should give you a feel for how you go about building your Constituent Database and your Supporter Database.</font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T5" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Acquire and prepare your voter data.</b></font><font>  Unless you have run for office before, you may not have a </font><font><i>Constituent Database</i></font><font>.   In that case, you may purchase voting records from the County Registrar of Voters.  Most are available in electronic form for a very reasonable price (often under $100 for a CD with full county information).  </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Voting records may come in many different formats - Tawala can import two different formats: </font><font><b>Excel</b></font><font> and </font><font><b>CSV</b></font><font> (Comma Separated Values).  If your records are in a different format, they are many different services and tools available on the Internet for converting your data into one of these. </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Once you have your data ready, press Submit.</font></paragraph></text>
<break/>
<heading label="H3" type="Sub"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Getting Started - Step Two</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T6" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="XGettingStarted" project=""><displayText><string value="cancel"/>
</displayText></invitation></u></font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T7" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Import your data into the temporary Import File. </b></font><font>Because importing can be hazardous, it is the only step that cannot be taken from within this application.  You will need to go to your CampaignDashboards Project Details page.  Here is link to take you there: </font><font><link-to-project-details version="1"><description><string value="CampaignDashboards Project Details Page"/>
</description><open-preference>new-window</open-preference></link-to-project-details></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font> It will open in a </font><font><i>separate window</i></font><font> so it's OK to click on it - you will still be able to refer to these directions.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Your Project Details Page should look a bit like this: </font><font><i>  (If you were not already logged into CampaignDashboards.com, you are first  taken to the LogIn page and asked to enter your user name and password - your should have gotten those when Customer Service helped you set this application up.)</i></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><image id="image1" width="753" height="439"><metafileHeader fileType="1" headerSize="9" version="768" fileSize="496131" numOfObjects="0" maxRecordSize="496104" numOfParams="0" />
</image></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>The top Form is entitled </font><font><i>ImportFile.</i></font><font>  If the number under the Responses heading is not zero, it means that the file already has some contents in it.  It is generally a good idea to save those contents before taking the next steps unless you know that they are no longer of any value.  That's what the third Actions icon on the right side of the page does, the sheet of paper with a green right arrow on it - it saves or exports all the records in the </font><font><i>ImportFile</i></font><font> form.  (If you hover over an icon, an explanation of what it does should appear.)  Click on the </font><font><i>Export</i></font><font> icon and follow the simple imstructions that appear to save a copy of the file data on your own computer.</font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T8" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>You may wonder what the Export button under the Project Actions Header does and why you aren't using that.  Well, CampaignDashboards contains dozens of Forms, and that buttons saves all of them at one time.  That's saving a good deal more information than you need to at the moment.</font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T9" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Once you have saved any data in </font><font><i>ImportFileI, </i></font><font>it is OK to purge or delete that data from the form.  That's what the fifth icon in the row is for (a little garbage can).  Click on that, and the number under responses should change to zero.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Now you are ready to Import your data.  The fourth icon from the left (a square with a blue bar at the top and a small upward green arrow below) is the Import button.  Click on that and follow the directions, assigning each field of data that you wish to import to a different column in </font><font><i>ImportFile</i></font><font>.  Keep track of what you put in each column.  Some contents (like Home Phone versus Office Phone) are easy to confuse.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Once you are done, you should receive a message telling you how many records were imported.  That number should match the number under the Responses tab in the picture above.  And you can look at a sample of the data by clicking on the first icon, the magnifying glass.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>At this point you have completed your voter data import.  Press Submit to continue.</font></paragraph></text>
<break/>
<heading label="H4" type="Sub"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Getting Started - Step Three</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T10" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="XGettingStarted" project=""><displayText><string value="cancel"/>
</displayText></invitation></u></font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T11" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Transfer your data from the temporary </b></font><font><b><i>ImportFile</i></b></font><font><b> to the proprietary Constituent Database.</b></font><sp/><sp/></paragraph></text>
<skipInstructions>
<skip to="__EndOfForm__"/>
</skipInstructions>
</items>
</form>
<form name="Setup" startPoint="false" themePath="lime" process="Post-Setup" preProcess="Pre-Setup" blockBackButton="false">
<items>
<skipInstructions>
<if>
<conditions>
<equals field="SetupNavigation">
<string value="StaffDashboards"/>
</equals>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<skip to="H2"/>
</trueSet>
</if>
</skipInstructions>
<heading label="H1" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Basic Information Setup</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T1" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="D20000"><b><i><field name="Message"/></i></b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>The Administrator is the person in charge of this software.  The Administrator has the master keys to all of the information managed by this program.</font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q1" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Administrator:</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="AdminName"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Email Address: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="AdminEmail"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Phone Number: </font><blank label="c" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="AdminPhone"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<fib label="Q2" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Administrator Password: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="AdminPass"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Repeat Password: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="DupePass"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T2" style="error"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><i>Note: If you forget your password, you can retrieve it from your MyTawala site in the Setup Form.  Look under the column entitled "Password."</i></font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q3" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Campaign Information:</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Candidate Name:</font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="Canddate"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Campaign Name: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignNm"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Main Phone: </font><blank label="c" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignPh"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Web site URL: </font><blank label="d" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignURL"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>Mailing Address</i></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Street or PO: </font><blank label="e" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignStreet"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">City: </font><blank label="f" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignCity"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">State: </font><blank label="g" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignST"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Zip: </font><blank label="h" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="CampaignZip"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<fib label="Q4" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Name of Election or Primary: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false" alternateLabel="Election"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Date of Election or Primary </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>(mm/dd/yyyy): </i></font><blank label="b" length="5" required="false" alternateLabel="ElecMo"></blank><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">/</font><blank label="c" length="6" required="false" alternateLabel="ElecDay"></blank><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">/</font><blank label="d" length="9" required="false" alternateLabel="ElecYr"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T3" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>One person can manage an entire campaign through a single dashboard.  However, many campaigns have people in multiple staff roles (Campaign Manager, Communications Director, Campaign Finance Director, etc), and give each different responsibilities and types of authority. </font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q5" alternateLabel="Mgmt" onlyone="true" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Manage this campaign through a single Dashboard</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="b"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Create multiple Dashboards for different campaign staff</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<skipInstructions>
<if>
<conditions>
<doesNotEqual field="Setup:AdminPass">
<string field="Setup:DupePass"/>
</doesNotEqual>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<set field="Message" arithmeticAsText="false">
<string value="Copies of password must match!"/>
</set>
<skip to="H1"/>
</trueSet>
</if>
<if>
<conditions>
<mcEquals field="Setup:Mgmt" value="a"/>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<skip to="__EndOfForm__"/>
</trueSet>
</if>
</skipInstructions>
<heading label="H2" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Staff Dashboards</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T4" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Please check the fields that you want to maintain for all staff members:</font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q6" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Title or Name of Staff Position</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q7" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Second email address </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>(primary email address is non-optional)</i></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q8" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Work phone</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q9" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Home phone</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q10" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Cell phone</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q11" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Mailing Address</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<heading label="H3" type="Sub"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Permission Categories</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T5" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Please indicate functions that you want to restrict on some Dashboards (i.e. not give to everybody)</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><i>Note: If you do not check a category below,  </i></font><font><b><i>all</i></b></font><font><i> Dashboards will have an unrestricted ability to use that functionality.</i></font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T6" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b><i>Databases:</i></b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><i>View information in Databases</i></font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q12" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">View individual records in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Proprietary Constituent Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q13" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">View individual records in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<text label="T7" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><i>Modify information in Databases</i></font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q14" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Add, edit or modify </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>personal data</i></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Proprietary Constituent Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q15" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Add, edit or modify </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>issues and polling responses </i></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Proprietary Constituent Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q16" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Add, edit or modify </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>financial contribution data</i></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q17" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Add, edit or modify </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>volunteer data</i></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q18" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Add, edit or modify </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><i>volunteer categories</i></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<text label="T8" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b><i>Communications:</i></b></font></paragraph></text>
<mc label="Q19" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Send communications to individuals in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Proprietary Constituent Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q20" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Send communications to financial contributors in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q21" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Send communications to volunteers in </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Supporter Database</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<mc label="Q22" onlyone="false" required="false" style="vertical"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Append polling questions to communications</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
<skipInstructions>
<if>
<conditions>
<equals field="SetupNavigation">
<string value="StaffDashboards"/>
</equals>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<skip to="__EndOfForm__"/>
</trueSet>
</if>
</skipInstructions>
<heading label="H4" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Web Quick Links</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T9" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>You may place links to Web pages that you would like to have appear on the various Dashboards.  This is a good way to consolidate links to related sites as well as allowing you to create shortcuts deep into this software for various staff members.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Staff members may change these as they wish.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Please include the "http://" prefix with all of your links.  Leave as many blank as you like.</font></paragraph></text>
<field name="StaffIDNumber"/>
<fib label="Q23" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Link Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Line URL: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T10" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>---------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q24" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Link Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Line URL: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T11" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>---------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q25" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Link Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Line URL: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T12" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>---------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q26" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Link Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Line URL: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<text label="T13" style="normal"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>---------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q27" style="leftAlignLabelsJustified"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Link Name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Line URL: </font><blank label="b" length="20" required="false"></blank></paragraph></fib>
<field name="IDSeed"/>
</items>
</form>
